From 6a9afce50f41811e91a32a3e04d77691398316ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxim Prokhorov <prokhorov.max@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 13:19:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] Move exception strings into flash

port of the original patch for containers and regex, modified in bulk
by libstd_flash_string_decls.py

note that stdexcept handlers in use here construct std::string, which
means static string either has to be manually safely copied there OR
unaligned reads exceptions handler has to be enabled at the same time

still useful and seamless for the case of -fno-exceptions, though
since error strings are printed using flash-string-aware routines
